---
title: Sunny Parfait
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@large marshmallows{32}
@boiling water{0.75%cup}
@frozen orange juice{0.25%cup}
@whipped cream{1%cup}
@orange food coloring

Add marshmallows to boiling water and stir till dissolved. Add orange juice and chill until thick. Whip until fluffy and fold in whipped cream. To half of the mixture, add a few drops of orange food coloring. Arrange alternate layers of the 2 mixtures in parfait glasses. Chill several hours.
